            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以此长度的牵引距离跟随指针，即使手部抖动也可画出平滑线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
